Original Timmkoo Q3 software **MX2E-WVGA_TM-WV3.23-20250528**.

- Model: **Q3** (Timmkoo)
- Package: `rom_q3.zip`
- Build tag: `MX2E-WVGA_TM-WV3.23-20250528`
- Build date: 2025-05-28

## Install

1. Download `rom_q3.zip` (every numbered volume if the release has more than one, then `cat rom_q3.zip.* &gt; rom_q3.zip`).
2. Unzip it. Keep the scatter file next to the images.
3. Open SP Flash Tool, choose **Download Only**, load the scatter file from the archive and flash.
4. Or use Innioasis Updater CE: &lt;https://innioasis.app/guide.html&gt;

This wipes the player. Back up music and recordings first.

